+; Preserve caller flags and current native20..43 scratch; no phase ZP/staticC
+; software stack, no high96 writes. Native FILES/UCI use their existing state.
+.macro API body
+ php
+ sei
+ cld
+ ldx #0
+: lda $20,x
+ pha
+ inx
+ cpx #36
+ bne :-
+ jsr body
+ sta retA
+ stx retX
+ ldx #35
+: pla
+ sta $20,x
+ dex
+ bpl :-
+ lda retA
+ ldx retX
+ plp
+ rts
+.endmacro
